Description: GTK 4 scroll view with Android's stretch overscroll - introspection
 SpongyScrollView is a GTK 4 scrolled window that flings and stretches the
 way Android's lists do, on libspongy's physics.
 .
 This package contains the introspection data, for GJS and Python.

