Description: Android scroll physics (stretch overscroll, fling) - development files
 libspongy reimplements Android's scrolling physics in C; libspongy-gtk wraps
 it in a GTK 4 scroll view.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the pkg-config files and the GIR XML.

