Package: fonts-neo-roboto
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: fonts
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Roboto variable font as Android ships it, for the Neo apps
 Roboto 3 as a variable font (weight 100-900, width 75-100), as Android
 ships it, under the family name "Neo Roboto" so that a static Roboto
 installed on the system never stands in for it. libneo draws the Neo apps'
 text with it.

