Description: Calculator for GNOME Phone
 The LineageOS/AOSP ExactCalculator rebuilt in GTK 4: exact real arithmetic
 that keeps every digit you scroll to, the formula and result display,
 history, and the advanced pad.

Package: neo-calendar
Architecture: any
Depends: evolution-data-server,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: gnome-phone-daemons,
Description: Calendar for GNOME Phone
 The LineageOS Etar calendar rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: day,
 month and agenda views, the event editor, and reminders that notify with the
 app closed (neo-calendar-reminders, a user service). With neo-wakeup
 (gnome-phone-daemons) a reminder wakes the phone from suspend.

Package: neo-clock
Architecture: any
