         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: gnome-phone-daemons,
            feedbackd,
            gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
Description: Clock for GNOME Phone
 The LineageOS DeskClock rebuilt in GTK 4: alarms, world clocks, timers, the
 stopwatch and the screen saver. Alarms and timers ring with the app closed
 (neo-clock-alarms, a user service). With neo-wakeup (gnome-phone-daemons) an
 alarm wakes the phone from suspend.

