Package: neo-dialer
Architecture: any
Depends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
         sound-theme-freedesktop,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: modemmanager,
            callaudiod,
            feedbackd,
            evolution-data-server,
            gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
Description: Phone app for GNOME Phone
 The LineageOS Dialer rebuilt in GTK 4: favorites, recents and contacts, the
 dialpad, the call log, blocked numbers, and the in-call and incoming-call
 screens. Calls go through ModemManager and callaudiod; contacts come from
 evolution-data-server. Calls ring with the app closed (neo-dialer-calls, a
 user service).

Package: neo-messaging
Architecture: any
Depends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
         sound-theme-freedesktop,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: modemmanager,
            feedbackd,
            evolution-data-server,
Description: Messaging app for GNOME Phone
 The LineageOS Messaging app rebuilt in GTK 4 for SMS through ModemManager:
 conversations, the composer, forwarding, archiving and blocked contacts.
 Messages are taken off the modem and notified with the app closed
 (neo-messaging-sms, a user service).

